      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Storage contract requires verification",
      "items": [
        "No packing manifest was verified. select_token_dtype chooses uint16 for GPT-2 vocabulary 50,257, while ShardWindows assumes uint32. Verify emitted packing dtype before claiming compatibility.",
        "160 \u00d7 50M tokens is 8B budget arithmetic, not an inventory. On-disk bytes depend on emitted dtype."
